---
import Headline from "../../shared/Headline.astro";
import Paragraph from "../../shared/Paragraph.astro";
import Wrapper from "../../shared/Wrapper.astro";
import "./intro.scss";

import suzyLaptop from "../../../assets/suzy-bio-image.png";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
---

<div class="speaking-mc-intro">
  <Wrapper>
    <div class="speaking-mc-intro-left">
      <div class="speaking-mc-intro-left-title">
        <Headline ele="h2" hlstyle="two"
          >LOOKING FOR A KEYNOTE SPEAKER <br />THAT TELLS A STORY &amp; SELLS?</Headline
        >
      </div>
      <div class="speaking-mc-intro-left-content">
        <Paragraph pstyle="one">
          <strong>Why storytelling matters right now…</strong><br /> Trust is harder
          to earn these days. Consumers are skeptical of ads and polished sales messages.
          Storytelling humanizes your brand and builds authenticity — which builds
          trust.
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph>
          Customer attention is fractured. We’re competing with endless
          scrolling and constant notifications. Stories cut through the noise
          because they engage emotion, not just logic. Suzy’s talks will help
          you cut to the chase with a story.
        </Paragraph>

        <Paragraph>
          <strong>Why your audience will care</strong><br /> People buy identity,
          not just products. Customers want to belong and align with brands that
          reflect who they are and who they aspire to be. Story helps them see themselves
          in your mission. Emotion drives action. Neuroscience consistently shows
          that emotion influences decision-making more than facts alone. Stories
          create emotional connection — and connection leads to action.
        </Paragraph>

        <Paragraph>
          <strong>What makes this keynote different</strong><br /> Suzy Rounce is
          seeking to make this a rally cry for founders, marketers, and teams on
          how to build culture, marketing, and customer experience around a single
          compelling narrative. Her 25 years of marketing and design experience with
          businesses give you a deep-dive perspective of what has worked over the
          years. There are plenty of approaches that didn’t resonate so these talks
          are fine-tuned to deliver the best and most exciting ideas.
        </Paragraph>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="speaking-mc-intro-right">
      <div class="speaking-mc-intro-right-image">
        <Image
          src={suzyLaptop}
          alt={"Suzy Rounce"}
          width={suzyLaptop.width}
          height={suzyLaptop.height}
        />
      </div>
      <div class="speaking-mc-intro-right-dates">
        <div class="speaking-mc-intro-right-dates-block">
          <h3>Suzy Rounce</h3>
          <h3>KEYNOTE SPEAKER</h3>
          <p>Co-Founder, Creative Director</p>
        </div>
        <div class="speaking-mc-intro-right-dates-block">
          <p>
            We won’t just delve into theory– We’ll speak to practical and
            applicable marketing knowledge that you can put into action
            immediately.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="speaking-mc-intro-right-dates-block">
          <p>This is the plot twist your marketing needs.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Wrapper>
</div>
